WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.780
Maxie: That's Benny.

2
00:00:05.781 --> 00:00:08.581
Taco: Who is Benny?

3
00:00:08.582 --> 00:00:13.335
Maxie: He is my brother. Hi, Benny!

4
00:00:13.336 --> 00:00:15.448
Benny: Who is this?

5
00:00:15.449 --> 00:00:18.560
Maxie: This is my friend Taco.

6
00:00:18.561 --> 00:00:24.398
Benny: It's nice to meet you.

7
00:00:24.399 --> 00:00:27.669
Taco: Wh . . . who . . . who is that?

8
00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:29.935
Benny: That's Smiley.

9
00:00:29.936 --> 00:00:35.322
Maxie: And that's his sister Happy.

10
00:00:35.323 --> 00:00:45.792
Benny: Hurry, Maxie!

11
00:00:45.793 --> 00:00:50.703
Maxie: Whew! That was close!

